          "merged_at": "2026-08-18T06:47:07Z"
        },
        "body": "## What changed\n\n- detect the Vinted registration/login state from actionable auth controls instead of depending on one wrapper test id\n- handle the observed `/member/register/select_type` screen where `auth-select-type--register-switch` is visible but `select-type-register-view` is absent\n- preserve normal click -> DOM click -> href fallback for switching auth views\n- restrict direct auth href fallback to trusted Vinted URLs\n- use the shared bounded Vinted navigation logic for login home navigation\n- wait briefly for the visible catalog search shell after `/catalog` navigation to avoid an immediate post-DOMContentLoaded race in market-stat SEARCH_QUERY scans\n\n## Evidence from the latest dry-run log\n\n- scheduler reached RUNNING=3, working=3, activeSlots=3 with three different bots/jobs concurrently\n- bot 6 repeatedly failed at the Vinted registration select-type page with `Register switch attempts: 0`, while `auth-select-type--register-switch | Zaloguj się` was visibly present\n- market stats finished 75/76 because one SEARCH_QUERY target checked for the catalog input before the client-rendered shell appeared\n\n## Safety\n\n- no real-action flag or limit is changed\n- no submit behavior is changed\n- authentication href fallback remains fail-closed outside trusted Vinted hosts\n- catalog readiness wait is a soft guard; existing caller validation still remains authoritative\n\n## Validation\n\n- branch is based directly on current main after PR #38\n- manual code review completed against the exact failure paths from the uploaded runtime log\n- local Maven execution was not available in the assistant environment; repository status checks will be inspected before merge",
